{
  "_note": "Post formats (2026-10-16, template-first). Every layout is a solid theme panel with the text plus a separate image slot (the picture is cropped into it; text never sits on the picture); zones may not overlap each other or the image slot (checked at load). provider is fixed per format and never swapped: Roman formats comfyui (RunPod, Roman's LoRA), the rest openrouter; a slide or format without an image slot is rendered by the app alone (free). content/formats.py picks: never the format or theme of the previous post on that platform; Roman formats only on the calendar's weekly Roman row ('roman') or 'as <format>'. Titles shrink within their size range; a title that still does not fit fails the dry run. v6 (PRD R3.1 pattern 3): the light and bright-blue themes produced rejected images; all three themes are now the dark bases sampled from the approved references (config/brand.json sampledColors): navy, panel navy and carousel black.",
